  "description": "The Count Solo is an affordable cross-country bike that is suitable for everyday use. The lightweight aluminium frame with balanced geometry ensures a harmonious and safe riding experience. High-quality and robust components complete the image of the all-rounder mountain bike. In addition to the classic size recommendations, the five frame sizes also give you the option of selecting the right size for your intended use – if you care about a particularly agile and playful riding feel, this can be achieved with a smaller frame size, while a larger size offers more stable riding behaviour at high speeds. Thanks to Solo-Air suspension, the RockShox Judy Silver TK can be adjusted to your individual needs. With its 100mm travel, it offers convincing suspension performance in a wide range of riding situations – harder tuning offers more control on the trail, softer tuning gives you a comfortable ride in everyday use. The lockout function can be controlled from the handlebar to allow for efficient pedalling and a good uphill performance of the Count Solo. The reliable shifting components of the Deore 6100 groupset have a 510% range and ensure that you’re always in the right gear. Based on the technologies of the top components, it not only offers uncomplicated handling, but above all smooth shifting processes and absolute reliability, making it the perfect shifting system for ambitious riders. The lightweight, yet powerful SHIMANO BR-MT4100 DEORE 2-piston brake provides a constant braking performance and precise modulation, just as you would expect from a hydraulic disc brake. Moreover, it stands out for its durability and ease of use. The Sunringle Düroc wheelset is the foundation for years of carefree riding pleasure and, in combination with the Kenda Booster tyres, offers the best grip with low weight and first-class rolling characteristics - whether asphalt, gravel or forest trail - feel inspired by maximum control. * approx. 12.9 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt black grey frame, size M, without pedals",
